# AI checkpoint (start here)

This file is the **handoff log** for any agent or model working on SchoolCRM. Do not re-explore the whole repo from scratch. Read this, then the other `.cursor/rules/schoolcrm-*.mdc` files, then only open code you need.

## Protocol (mandatory)

1. **Start:** Read this file. Treat "Current checkpoint" as truth unless git/workspace contradicts it.
2. **During work:** Prefer existing portals (`admin/`, `teacher/`, root student pages). Do not mix `$_SESSION['id']` with `$_SESSION['user_id']`.
3. **After every user prompt that produces work, a decision, or new facts:** append a **newest-first** Work log entry (date, what happened, paths if any, leftover risk, next step). Also do this at **end of session**. Skip only empty/no-op turns (e.g. user only said "ok" with no new info).
4. **If architecture/auth/schema changes:** also update `schoolcrm-overview.mdc`, `schoolcrm-auth.mdc`, `schoolcrm-database.mdc`, or `schoolcrm-php.mdc`.
5. **Do not** put passwords, dumps of PII, or full SQL dumps in this file.

