### 2026-09-03 — Fix student login redirect (APP_BASE_PATH)

- **Root cause:** Empty `APP_BASE_PATH` in `.env` overrode auto-detect; Windows path case (`C:` vs `c:`) broke docroot detection → form posted to `http://localhost/backoffice/login.php` instead of `/SchoolCRM/backoffice/login.php`.
- **Fix:** `detect_app_base_path()` in `config/app.php` — case-insensitive docroot match + `SCRIPT_NAME` fallback; empty `.env` value now means auto-detect.
- **Verify:** Login → `/SchoolCRM/studentDashboard.php`; session cookie path `/SchoolCRM`.

